    "emerging_research": "Recent work explores NAC's role in respiratory health, autoimmune modulation, and liver support\u2014areas with mechanistic plausibility but limited human clinical data. Some early evidence suggests potential benefits in cognitive resilience and heavy metal detoxification, though these remain investigational and require confirmation in larger populations.",
    "caveats": "NAC is generally well-tolerated, but high doses or prolonged use warrant medical oversight, particularly in people with bleeding disorders or cysteine metabolism issues. Quality varies by brand; pharmaceutical-grade NAC is preferable to unregulated supplements. Long-term safety in all populations has not been exhaustively studied.",
